# union_library overrides: one directive per line.
#   match <deemix-name> = <lidarr-artist>/<lidarr-album>         force dedupe, Lidarr target
#   prefer-deemix <deemix-name> = <lidarr-artist>/<lidarr-album> force match, keep Deemix target
#   keep-both <deemix-name> = <lidarr-artist>/<lidarr-album>     suppress dedupe, emit both
# Names are the literal folder names. Unmatched lines are reported as unused.

# 'And' vs '&' defeats the normaliser; same release, so dedupe onto the Lidarr copy.
match Eek-A-Mouse - The Mouse And The Man = Eek‐A‐Mouse/The Mouse & The Man (1983)
